Dialogue: 6,0:17:58.93,0:18:00.12,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,不覚
Dialogue: 6,0:18:03.07,0:18:04.94,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ざ…ざ…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:05.70,0:18:06.90,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,雑魚では
Dialogue: 6,0:18:16.41,0:18:17.70,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,深月さん　これ
Dialogue: 6,0:18:17.70,0:18:19.33,Dial_JP,,0,900,0,,さんさきですよね
Dialogue: 6,0:18:20.42,0:18:21.92,Dial_JP,,0,900,0,,はあ…まあ
Dialogue: 5,0:18:24.13,0:18:25.34,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Round 1
Dialogue: 6,0:18:24.13,0:18:25.34,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,Round 1
Dialogue: 5,0:18:25.84,0:18:27.05,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Fight
Dialogue: 6,0:18:25.84,0:18:27.05,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,Fight
Dialogue: 6,0:18:31.89,0:18:34.47,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ああ　そりゃそうか
Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.08,0:18:34.47,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Final Round
Dialogue: 6,0:18:33.08,0:18:34.47,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,Final Round
Dialogue: 6,0:18:34.47,0:18:38.08,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ただでさえ　女格ゲーマーは生息数が少ない
Dialogue: 5,0:18:34.47,0:18:35.53,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Fight
Dialogue: 6,0:18:34.47,0:18:35.53,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,Fight
Dialogue: 6,0:18:38.08,0:18:42.02,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,ましてや　名門女子高で\N強いプレイヤーと出会う確率なんて
Dialogue: 6,0:18:42.63,0:18:46.15,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,なんか　ガード堅くなってないか
Dialogue: 5,0:18:47.33,0:18:51.28,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波動拳…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:47.33,0:18:51.28,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,波動拳…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:51.86,0:18:53.99,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,急に壊れたように波動を
Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.99,0:18:55.70,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波動拳…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:53.99,0:18:55.70,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,波動拳…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:56.18,0:18:58.16,Dial_JP,,0,0,0,,だったら　次の波動を…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:58.48,0:18:59.22,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波掌撃
Dialogue: 6,0:18:58.48,0:18:59.22,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,波掌撃
Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.22,0:18:59.78,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}そこだ
Dialogue: 6,0:18:59.22,0:18:59.78,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,そこだ
Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.01,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目を逸らすな
Dialogue: 6,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.01,Dial_SF6_JP,,0,0,0,,目を逸らすな
